01:59.280 --> 02:02.220
[Lan Yue Group Phase II Resort
Internal Bidding Conference]

02:04.140 --> 02:07.830
[Lan Yue Group Phase II Resort
Internal Bidding Conference]

02:21.910 --> 02:22.880
Who is he?

02:22.910 --> 02:24.710
I don't think I've seen him before.

02:24.710 --> 02:26.640
