02:26.930 --> 02:28.930
I feel like I've seen him somewhere.

02:31.650 --> 02:33.160
[Lan Yue Group Phase II Resort
Internal Bidding Conference]

02:43.910 --> 02:45.120
Alright, everyone.

02:45.630 --> 02:47.280
Since you're all here,

02:47.470 --> 02:49.100
