02:49.560 --> 02:50.280
This is

02:50.280 --> 02:51.470
our group company's

02:51.470 --> 02:52.910
first internal bidding.

02:52.910 --> 02:54.150
Its purpose is

02:54.150 --> 02:55.590
to select the most capable

02:55.590 --> 02:57.870
and innovative construction team

02:58.079 --> 03:00.150
for the Phase II resort project—

03:00.150 --> 03:02.960
a project with enormous potential.

03:03.080 --> 03:04.030
I believe that

03:04.150 --> 03:05.030
through this

03:05.030 --> 03:06.630
exchange and presentation,

03:06.840 --> 03:08.520
we will definitely propose

03:08.520 --> 03:10.310
an excellent project proposal,

03:10.310 --> 03:12.520
laying a solid foundation

03:12.710 --> 03:15.110
for the future advancement of the project.

03:16.630 --> 03:19.670
[Dingshang Construction]

03:17.960 --> 03:18.960
Alright.

03:18.960 --> 03:20.710
Put your enthusiasm for clapping

03:20.710 --> 03:22.520
