03:28.050 --> 03:31.579
[Dingshang Construction]

03:28.430 --> 03:30.960
First, please welcome Boxing Construction.

03:33.030 --> 03:33.680
Hello, everyone.

03:33.680 --> 03:35.880
I am Zhou Wan from Boxing Construction.

03:37.680 --> 03:39.000
Our design proposal is themed around

03:39.000 --> 03:41.550
"Long-Term Stay, Home Away from Home"—

03:42.000 --> 03:43.710
