03:44.120 --> 03:46.520
creating a second home

03:46.540 --> 03:47.540
for our guests.

03:48.520 --> 03:49.960
Vacation is about escaping

03:49.960 --> 03:51.150
the trivial and exhausting

03:51.150 --> 03:52.190
daily routine.

03:52.310 --> 03:53.450
More and more people lack

03:53.450 --> 03:54.680
a sense of security

03:54.700 --> 03:55.750
and belonging at home.

03:55.750 --> 03:56.630
That's why

03:56.630 --> 03:57.960
our proposal

03:57.960 --> 04:00.400
rejects the traditional notion

04:00.400 --> 04:02.840
that resorts equal luxury but distance.

04:12.630 --> 04:13.830
I want to be with you.

04:15.150 --> 04:16.000
Lu Xixiao.

04:20.720 --> 04:21.279
Okay.

04:24.560 --> 04:28.100
[Dingshang Construction]
[Boxing Construction]

04:31.670 --> 04:33.550
