17:55.070 --> 17:55.920
You're not actually mad about

17:55.920 --> 17:57.130
Zhou Wan leaving, are you?

17:57.130 --> 17:58.810
I was going to wake you up,

17:59.720 --> 18:00.480
but you were sleeping

18:00.480 --> 18:01.400
so soundly.

18:02.750 --> 18:03.950
I just couldn't do it.

18:09.450 --> 18:10.380
I did sleep well.

18:14.270 --> 18:15.830
No wonder all those sleep aids

18:15.830 --> 18:17.430
over the years never worked.

18:17.580 --> 18:18.980
The real cure is a person.

18:21.000 --> 18:22.280
You haven't eaten yet.
Where are you going?

18:22.280 --> 18:23.040
To work.

18:23.270 --> 18:23.930
Seriously?

18:24.270 --> 18:26.270
Are you really going to keep working

18:26.550 --> 18:27.790
at Dingshang?

18:27.790 --> 18:28.550
What about the art exhibition?

18:28.550 --> 18:30.010
You're there, aren't you?

18:30.510 --> 18:31.400
What good is me being there?

18:31.400 --> 18:32.510
They appreciate your paintings,

18:32.510 --> 18:33.240
man.

18:33.240 --> 18:33.880
The exhibition

18:33.880 --> 18:34.920
was supposed to start in September,

18:34.920 --> 18:36.160
and now we've got no venue

18:36.160 --> 18:37.510
and no finalized pieces.

18:37.510 --> 18:38.070
Are you trying

18:38.070 --> 18:39.110
to get me fired?

18:39.110 --> 18:39.680
If I can't pay my mortgage,

18:39.680 --> 18:40.680
I'll live here with you
for the rest of my life!

18:40.680 --> 18:41.590
We're just short of a few paintings.

18:41.590 --> 18:42.270
Give me a month,

18:42.270 --> 18:43.350
and I'll make up for them, okay?

18:43.350 --> 18:44.000
Fine.

18:44.000 --> 18:45.200
That's what you said.

18:47.720 --> 18:48.910
Lend me your phone for a sec.

18:48.910 --> 18:50.270
I want to check Gu Meng's Moments.

18:50.270 --> 18:51.910
Don't you have your own phone?

18:51.910 --> 18:53.440
I transferred her
the mortgage this morning,

18:53.440 --> 18:54.500
and she blocked me.

18:55.550 --> 18:56.610
She blocked me too.

18:58.590 --> 18:59.450
Unbelievable.

19:02.200 --> 19:03.030
I got home at 2 a.m. last night

19:03.030 --> 19:04.070
and crashed.

19:04.720 --> 19:05.920
I'm so exhausted.

19:08.350 --> 19:10.030
Play, keep playing.

19:10.590 --> 19:11.920
Aren't you doing well?

19:14.280 --> 19:18.050
[Real Estate Bidding Proposal]

19:14.590 --> 19:16.000
Our second-round bidding

19:16.000 --> 19:17.240
is starting soon.

19:17.240 --> 19:18.030
What's with

19:18.190 --> 19:19.590
everyone slacking off?

19:19.590 --> 19:20.510
What's wrong?

19:21.720 --> 19:23.510
Dingshang has a rich heir in charge.

19:23.510 --> 19:24.110
What's the point of

19:24.110 --> 19:25.110
us trying so hard?

19:26.240 --> 19:28.310
Zhou Wan, what do you think?

19:30.270 --> 19:32.270
Ms. Zhou Wan, Mr. Niu is calling you.

19:32.720 --> 19:34.780
Zhou Wan, you aren't scared, are you?

19:34.880 --> 19:36.160
That's not your style.

19:40.440 --> 19:41.200
I think we still

19:41.200 --> 19:42.200
have a chance.

19:42.010 --> 19:48.140
[Real Estate Bidding Proposal]

19:45.550 --> 19:46.310
The whole point

19:46.310 --> 19:48.110
of Lan Yue's internal bidding

19:48.350 --> 19:49.590
is to break away

19:49.590 --> 19:50.680
from the old model

19:50.920 --> 19:52.160
and pick the team

19:52.160 --> 19:53.480
that's best for Phase II.

19:53.480 --> 19:55.080
Boxing has solid experience

19:55.310 --> 19:56.640
and a budget advantage.

19:57.000 --> 19:57.680
In round one,

19:57.680 --> 19:58.440
our proposal

19:58.440 --> 19:59.680
was highly praised,

19:59.720 --> 20:00.850
and you all saw that.

20:03.880 --> 20:04.640
Besides,

20:07.960 --> 20:10.020
Lu Xixiao has been abroad for so long,

20:10.070 --> 20:11.880
and has no foundation in Lan Yue.

20:13.210 --> 20:14.200
And Boxing is not

20:14.200 --> 20:16.400
completely without support in Lan Yue.

20:17.110 --> 20:18.110
Listen up.

20:19.350 --> 20:20.480
Well said.

20:20.750 --> 20:21.920
Let me tell you,

20:21.960 --> 20:22.920
don't just think

20:23.030 --> 20:24.360
Dingshang has Mr. Lu Jr.

20:24.510 --> 20:25.910
We have connections too.

20:26.000 --> 20:28.000
Everyone in this Phase II bidding

20:28.070 --> 20:29.640
has some leverage.

20:29.750 --> 20:31.270
So do your best.

20:31.270 --> 20:33.200
It's still unknown who will win.

20:35.310 --> 20:36.160
The second round

20:36.160 --> 20:37.000
is tight and demanding.

20:37.000 --> 20:37.510
We can't

20:37.510 --> 20:38.480
afford to slack off.

20:38.480 --> 20:39.070
Nor can we

20:39.070 --> 20:40.000
take any chances

20:40.000 --> 20:41.310
with this voting assessment

20:41.310 --> 20:42.210
because of my identity.

20:42.210 --> 20:43.030
If we want to win

20:43.030 --> 20:43.590
the resort's Phase II,

20:43.590 --> 20:44.400
it has to be

20:44.400 --> 20:45.550
on our own merits.

20:45.550 --> 20:46.440
But to be honest,

20:46.440 --> 20:47.590
I don't have any practical

20:47.590 --> 20:48.790
experience with a project this big,

20:48.790 --> 20:49.750
so I've brought in

20:49.750 --> 20:50.510
the best domestic

20:50.510 --> 20:51.400
real estate bidding team

20:51.400 --> 20:52.750
to back us up this time.

20:52.750 --> 20:53.350
Mr. Gao.

20:54.590 --> 20:55.790
Boxing now has a clear advantage

20:55.790 --> 20:56.880
in budget.

20:56.880 --> 20:58.400
So we must find a way

20:58.400 --> 20:59.310
to turn the enemy's advantage

20:59.310 --> 21:00.400
into our own.

21:00.400 --> 21:01.550
Make sure we win

21:01.550 --> 21:02.590
this bidding.

21:02.750 --> 21:03.790
Yes!

21:16.270 --> 21:17.000
Well done.

21:17.750 --> 21:19.150
Mr. Lu, please sign here.

21:25.400 --> 21:25.920
Mr. Lu,

21:26.160 --> 21:28.020
the risk assessment team is here.

21:31.160 --> 21:31.960
It's Mr. Zhao.

21:31.960 --> 21:32.750
Mr. Zhao.

21:32.970 --> 21:33.550
Hello, Mr. Lu.

21:33.550 --> 21:34.070
Hello.

21:34.960 --> 21:35.480
This time...

21:35.480 --> 21:36.080
Come, sit.

21:36.640 --> 21:37.830
We're counting on you

21:37.830 --> 21:38.790
for the Phase II

21:38.790 --> 21:40.160
risk assessment.

21:40.240 --> 21:40.720
Rest assured.

21:40.720 --> 21:42.070
This is the main direction for now.

21:42.070 --> 21:43.070
Take a look first.

21:43.590 --> 21:45.320
Wan, it's updated. Come quick.

21:45.350 --> 21:46.350
I'm busy.

21:46.350 --> 21:47.680
You watch it first, babe.

21:47.680 --> 21:49.270
Why are you working again?

21:49.270 --> 21:51.440
You... It's been three days.

21:51.720 --> 21:53.250
You're still working on it.

21:53.550 --> 21:55.480
You're going to burn yourself out.

21:56.750 --> 21:57.590
Thank you.

22:25.680 --> 22:27.440
What a feast.

22:28.130 --> 22:28.980
Take a seat.

22:29.110 --> 22:31.070
I was just wondering where to eat.

22:31.310 --> 22:32.510
Looks good.

22:32.510 --> 22:33.160
Is it okay?

22:33.830 --> 22:35.830
Is it from Xia's place?

22:36.750 --> 22:38.640
Yeah, since Uncle Kang went home,

22:38.640 --> 22:39.840
I ordered from there.

22:41.590 --> 22:43.520
You went all the way there to buy it?

22:44.940 --> 22:46.590
Don't you like their food?

22:48.160 --> 22:49.200
You're the best.

22:50.920 --> 22:51.480
Sorry

22:51.480 --> 22:52.550
I've been so busy lately.

22:52.550 --> 22:54.350
I haven't had a chance to ask you.

22:54.960 --> 22:57.160
How's your onboarding at Lan Yue going?

22:58.640 --> 23:00.440
Pretty smoothly.

23:01.310 --> 23:02.160
Let me.

23:04.480 --> 23:05.200
Even though

23:05.200 --> 23:07.350
I have the title of Strategy Director,

23:07.400 --> 23:08.240
I haven't really

23:08.240 --> 23:09.500
done any real work yet.

23:10.160 --> 23:11.480
Maybe because you just started,

23:11.480 --> 23:12.440
they want you to get

23:12.440 --> 23:14.170
familiar with the place first.

23:17.480 --> 23:18.480
Probably.

23:19.110 --> 23:20.880
But at least there
aren't any restrictions.

23:20.880 --> 23:22.010
I can do my own thing.

23:22.350 --> 23:23.750
Just take it as learning.

23:24.200 --> 23:25.200
Yeah, right.

23:32.790 --> 23:34.050
Why aren't you eating?

23:34.510 --> 23:35.720
Thank you.

23:36.310 --> 23:37.380
I should thank you

23:37.410 --> 23:39.270
for going so far to buy this for me.

23:41.550 --> 23:42.270
I've always felt like

23:42.270 --> 23:44.030
I don't have much luck with family.

23:44.030 --> 23:44.920
But with you,

23:44.920 --> 23:46.850
it feels like having a big brother.

23:50.200 --> 23:51.160
Just...

23:52.590 --> 23:53.590
a big brother?

23:55.720 --> 23:57.320
A younger brother works too.

24:01.830 --> 24:03.070
So, how do you think

24:03.680 --> 24:05.030
your big brother

24:05.750 --> 24:07.280
has been taking care of you?

24:08.840 --> 24:10.840
You've always taken good care of me.

24:11.790 --> 24:12.960
If you're willing,

24:14.600 --> 24:16.200
I can keep taking care of you.

24:20.400 --> 24:21.200
I'm sorry.

24:22.240 --> 24:23.310
I really have a lot of

24:23.310 --> 24:24.640
important things to do.

24:26.030 --> 24:26.720
I don't have the time

24:26.720 --> 24:27.720
or energy

24:28.070 --> 24:30.550
for a relationship.

24:42.960 --> 24:44.090
Is it because of him?

24:53.550 --> 24:54.610
If that's the case,

24:55.320 --> 24:56.450
I'm willing to wait.

24:58.310 --> 24:59.550
If one day

25:00.210 --> 25:00.960
you find yourself

25:00.960 --> 25:02.490
needing someone to lean on,

25:03.230 --> 25:04.270
I'll be here.

25:19.960 --> 25:21.030
The two of you

25:21.050 --> 25:22.090
ordered so many.

25:23.510 --> 25:24.840
Can you finish them all?

25:27.630 --> 25:28.960
What are you doing here?

25:31.720 --> 25:32.270
About tomorrow's

25:32.270 --> 25:33.600
second-round bidding,

25:34.710 --> 25:36.570
you really want to win, don't you?

25:41.920 --> 25:42.710
Lu Xixiao,

25:43.770 --> 25:45.200
you two are done now.

25:52.010 --> 25:53.250
Try begging me.

25:53.960 --> 25:55.070
Don't go too far.

25:58.380 --> 25:59.180
Is it fun?

26:00.990 --> 26:02.680
So many people are risking their work

26:02.680 --> 26:03.610
to play with you.

26:04.170 --> 26:05.130
Director Lu.

26:08.680 --> 26:09.790
I told you,

26:10.750 --> 26:11.400
Zhou Wan,

26:12.310 --> 26:13.770
don't let me see you again.

26:15.600 --> 26:16.850
If you do,

26:18.350 --> 26:19.880
I'll make you cry and beg me.

26:27.070 --> 26:27.960
Childish.

26:45.200 --> 26:46.660
I'll wait for you to beg me.

27:10.070 --> 27:11.530
I'll skip the food for now.

27:12.400 --> 27:13.530
I'm taking the beer.

27:46.960 --> 27:47.590
Hello, Xixiao?

27:47.590 --> 27:49.400
It's late now. What's up?

27:49.920 --> 27:51.310
Did you double-check the materials

27:51.310 --> 27:52.710
for tomorrow's bidding?

27:52.790 --> 27:54.110
I checked them with the team.

27:54.110 --> 27:55.240
There are no issues.

27:56.440 --> 27:57.680
Send me the digital copy.

27:57.680 --> 27:58.880
I'll review it again.

27:59.200 --> 28:00.680
N-Now?

28:01.240 --> 28:02.000
It's so late.

28:02.000 --> 28:03.310
Just send it.

28:04.160 --> 28:05.160
We must win

28:06.000 --> 28:07.200
tomorrow's bidding.

28:11.770 --> 28:17.230
[Lan Yue Group Phase II Resort
Internal Bidding Conference]

28:14.510 --> 28:15.590
Let's begin.

28:22.850 --> 28:28.750
[Lan Yue Group Phase II Resort]

28:36.680 --> 28:38.080
Dingshang won.

28:38.730 --> 28:39.770
Dingshang won.

28:40.200 --> 28:41.880
They won.

28:42.590 --> 28:43.530
Mr. Niu,

28:43.830 --> 28:45.270
we really tried our best.

28:45.360 --> 28:47.550
Their bid changed too fast.

28:47.550 --> 28:49.210
We didn't see it coming.

28:49.230 --> 28:51.240
D-Don't take it too hard.

28:55.150 --> 28:58.800
[Boxing Construction]

29:01.830 --> 29:03.440
It's so beautiful here.

29:03.440 --> 29:04.640
It really looks like

29:04.640 --> 29:05.900
a scene I saw in a movie.

29:06.920 --> 29:09.120
Come on, let's take a picture together.

29:09.680 --> 29:11.200
Just take one of yourself.

29:12.030 --> 29:13.480
You're the one
who wanted to come to the resort,

29:13.480 --> 29:16.410
but you're also the one
without any vacation spirit.

29:19.230 --> 29:20.360
-Nice.
-Be careful.

29:23.200 --> 29:24.730
I've been so busy lately.

29:24.930 --> 29:26.070
Finally getting a breather,

29:26.070 --> 29:27.310
so I wanted to get out.

29:27.650 --> 29:28.460
Yeah.

29:29.270 --> 29:31.200
I've only been to this resort once,

29:31.240 --> 29:32.310
even though it's right

29:32.310 --> 29:33.550
here in Pingchuan.

29:33.590 --> 29:35.050
Have you been here before?

29:39.550 --> 29:41.080
I came here when I was young.

29:41.200 --> 29:42.110
Did you?

29:42.110 --> 29:43.440
And you didn't bring me.

29:44.440 --> 29:45.750
Did we even know each other back then?

29:45.750 --> 29:46.510
Sis.

29:47.510 --> 29:48.790
How young was you?

29:51.440 --> 29:53.200
This used to be a factory,

29:53.880 --> 29:56.340
but it went bankrupt
due to poor management.

29:56.750 --> 29:57.750
After the land was taken back,

29:57.750 --> 29:59.550
they turned it into this resort.

30:00.680 --> 30:01.880
You can't even tell.

30:01.900 --> 30:03.030
They did a great job.

30:07.290 --> 30:08.490
But I still remember.

30:09.960 --> 30:10.680
The closer I get,

30:10.680 --> 30:12.010
the clearer it becomes.

30:14.480 --> 30:15.850
Who let you in here?

30:16.290 --> 30:19.570
[In Loving Memory]

30:24.240 --> 30:26.100
I came to see him for the last time.

30:26.700 --> 30:32.620
[In Loving Memory]

30:27.440 --> 30:28.240
Zhou Wan.

30:29.960 --> 30:32.460
I'm not the one who killed your father.

30:34.030 --> 30:35.620
You think you're smart,

30:36.530 --> 30:38.110
but you're hating

30:38.500 --> 30:41.440
[In Loving Memory]

30:38.790 --> 30:40.120
the wrong person.

30:41.750 --> 30:42.500
No, do you see

30:42.520 --> 30:43.590
-how many workers
-We can talk about the price.

30:43.590 --> 30:44.850
I have in this factory?

30:44.880 --> 30:45.920
If they lose this job,

30:45.920 --> 30:46.750
how can they support their families?

30:46.750 --> 30:47.550
What are these workers supposed to do?

30:47.550 --> 30:48.110
Come on.

30:48.680 --> 30:49.680
Mr. Zhou,

30:50.200 --> 30:52.350
y-you know the f-factory's been

30:52.440 --> 30:53.510
struggling for years.

30:53.380 --> 30:53.660
[Acquisition Contract]

30:53.510 --> 30:56.070
The price I'm offering you

30:53.800 --> 30:55.810
[Article 3 Overview and Guarantee]

30:55.870 --> 30:57.480
[RMB 8.4 million]

30:56.070 --> 30:57.960
isn't small.

30:57.960 --> 30:59.590
As for the workers,

31:00.920 --> 31:01.960
just give them some severance

31:01.960 --> 31:02.920
and send them off.

31:02.920 --> 31:03.400
Alright?

31:03.400 --> 31:04.590
Think about it.

31:04.830 --> 31:06.300
You can tell Mr. Lu

31:06.440 --> 31:08.160
to drop this idea.

31:08.180 --> 31:08.860
Just go.

31:10.200 --> 31:10.830
No.

31:10.980 --> 31:12.010
Wait, you—

31:13.030 --> 31:13.750
Do you even know

31:13.750 --> 31:15.120
what's going on with the factory?

31:15.120 --> 31:17.250
It's already unable to make ends meet.

31:17.310 --> 31:19.000
Fine. You want to be noble?

31:19.000 --> 31:20.510
You can stay with
this broken factory then.

31:20.510 --> 31:21.970
Don't bother coming home.

31:30.960 --> 31:32.480
I'm really not trying
to make things hard for you.

31:32.480 --> 31:34.440
-I can give you purchase orders.
-I know we've had

31:34.440 --> 31:35.310
a good partnership,

31:35.310 --> 31:36.830
but this price—

31:36.830 --> 31:37.550
I really can't do it.

31:37.550 --> 31:38.880
Mr. Zhang.

31:39.390 --> 31:41.110
-You've been here three times.
-I'll pay you later.

31:41.110 --> 31:42.790
I know, but I have no choice.

31:42.790 --> 31:43.880
-Please give me the goods.
-I'm sorry.

31:43.880 --> 31:44.750
Don't make things difficult for me.

31:44.750 --> 31:46.270
Why are you here again?

31:46.270 --> 31:47.110
I told you.

31:47.110 --> 31:48.680
-I can't give you that price.
-Mr. Sun, you have to…

31:48.680 --> 31:49.640
You have to help me.

31:49.640 --> 31:50.880
I have so many people

31:50.880 --> 31:52.030
counting on me.

31:52.110 --> 31:54.000
-I really can't. Try somewhere else.
-Think about it.

31:54.000 --> 31:54.790
No, it won't work.

31:54.790 --> 31:55.590
-I'm sorry.
-What if

31:55.590 --> 31:56.510
I write you an IOU?

31:56.510 --> 31:57.000
Zhang.

31:57.240 --> 31:59.920
-I really can't help you.
-I just want this batch of goods.

31:59.920 --> 32:00.480
Mr. Sun.

32:00.480 --> 32:01.940
Think about it, won't you?

32:02.160 --> 32:03.730
I'm sorry, Ms. Guo.

32:03.750 --> 32:04.640
I really can't.

32:13.710 --> 32:14.800
Hello, beauty.

32:15.400 --> 32:17.000
You're here to see the goods, right?

32:17.000 --> 32:17.720
I see you've been

32:17.720 --> 32:19.050
running around all day.

32:19.290 --> 32:20.480
Here's my card.

32:20.500 --> 32:21.310
Take a look.

32:22.100 --> 32:23.120
My surname is Huo,

32:23.140 --> 32:25.360
as in "genuine goods."

32:26.400 --> 32:27.200
I'm in

32:27.200 --> 32:28.750
the raw materials business.

32:28.750 --> 32:30.160
Look, these are my goods.

32:30.180 --> 32:30.980
Take a look.

32:31.800 --> 32:32.590
And this too.

32:33.780 --> 32:34.830
My goods

32:34.880 --> 32:36.010
are a third cheaper

32:36.240 --> 32:37.510
than other similar types

32:37.510 --> 32:39.000
in this factory.

32:39.830 --> 32:40.480
Think about it.

32:40.480 --> 32:41.110
Doesn't this save

32:41.110 --> 32:42.720
your factory a lot of money?

32:46.030 --> 32:47.070
Pay the money back!

32:47.070 --> 32:48.860
Zhou Jun, get out here!

32:48.960 --> 32:50.640
Zhou Jun, pay up!

32:50.640 --> 32:51.790
You can't take the fridge!

32:51.790 --> 32:53.000
There's still stuff inside, sir.

32:53.000 --> 32:53.550
Go away!

32:53.570 --> 32:55.200
-A debt must be paid!
-Sir. Sir.

32:55.200 --> 32:55.880
Take it!

32:56.100 --> 32:57.290
And you know

32:57.430 --> 32:58.890
what happened after that.

33:04.310 --> 33:05.840
Why are you telling me this?

33:10.270 --> 33:11.520
Thanks to you,

33:12.590 --> 33:13.990
I got all the retribution

33:14.250 --> 33:15.530
that I deserved.

33:17.550 --> 33:18.440
But after all,

33:19.350 --> 33:20.880
we're mother and daughter.

33:22.790 --> 33:24.520
Whatever there was between us,

33:27.400 --> 33:29.000
we should be even now, right?

33:36.850 --> 33:38.120
After I left,

33:38.240 --> 33:39.770
I went south for a few years,

33:40.030 --> 33:41.560
looking for work.

33:41.920 --> 33:43.650
During the day I waited tables.

33:43.960 --> 33:46.240
At night I couldn't sit still.

33:47.480 --> 33:49.030
I worked as a drink hostess

33:49.030 --> 33:50.230
in different places.

33:51.240 --> 33:52.440
Life was tough.

33:53.630 --> 33:54.730
I went through

33:54.940 --> 33:56.450
a lot in those years.

33:57.670 --> 33:59.200
It was also during that time

33:59.960 --> 34:01.760
that I met him for the first time.

34:03.380 --> 34:06.170
My boss said the rain was too heavy.

34:06.360 --> 34:08.550
-I recognize his secretary
-Don't get wet.

34:08.550 --> 34:09.400
as the one who came to buy

34:09.400 --> 34:10.760
our factory.

34:11.440 --> 34:13.239
But he didn't remember me at all.

34:15.960 --> 34:18.690
That experience
wasn't what I'd call beautiful,

34:19.290 --> 34:20.260
but it did

34:20.800 --> 34:22.620
teach me one thing.

34:23.510 --> 34:24.840
Men are simple.

34:25.710 --> 34:27.980
And Lu Zhongyue was no exception.

34:29.280 --> 34:30.630
I can never go back

34:30.630 --> 34:32.320
to the days when I was Guo Yan.

34:32.920 --> 34:34.000
Never.

34:34.679 --> 34:35.409
Next.

34:36.800 --> 34:38.210
Mr. Zhang, have another drink.

34:38.210 --> 34:39.030
Sorry.

34:39.030 --> 34:39.840
I need to take a call.

34:39.840 --> 34:40.440
You guys go ahead.

34:40.440 --> 34:41.030
Lu...

34:41.880 --> 34:42.320
Hello?

34:42.400 --> 34:44.110
Then I-I'll drink on behalf of Mr. Lu.

34:44.110 --> 34:44.960
Cheers.

34:44.960 --> 34:46.110
A toast to everyone.

34:46.110 --> 34:47.630
Come on, let's eat.

34:47.630 --> 34:49.000
I have plans tomorrow afternoon.

34:49.000 --> 34:51.460
Tomorrow afternoon definitely won't work.

35:22.230 --> 35:23.190
Please come in.

35:23.220 --> 35:24.020
Here they are.

35:24.070 --> 35:25.340
Hello, Mr. Lu.

35:25.720 --> 35:26.800
Hello, Mrs. Lu.

35:26.840 --> 35:27.150
Hello.

35:27.150 --> 35:27.800
Mr. Lu,

35:27.800 --> 35:29.000
you look even more handsome.

35:29.000 --> 35:30.590
And you've put on more weight.

35:30.590 --> 35:32.230
Come, this way.

35:33.190 --> 35:34.110
Once this resort

35:34.110 --> 35:35.070
is built,

35:35.230 --> 35:36.190
the business

35:36.190 --> 35:36.630
is going to

35:36.630 --> 35:37.960
be so booming.

35:38.550 --> 35:39.400
If it weren't for you

35:39.400 --> 35:40.840
making that introduction back then,

35:40.840 --> 35:41.360
I'd never have

35:41.360 --> 35:42.150
gotten such a big deal.

35:42.150 --> 35:42.800
Don't mention it.

35:42.800 --> 35:44.360
You've told it so many times.

35:44.360 --> 35:45.320
We're businessmen.

35:45.320 --> 35:46.110
It's all about mutual benefit.

35:46.110 --> 35:46.760
-Right.
-Think about it.

35:46.760 --> 35:47.840
If you hadn't helped,

35:47.840 --> 35:48.480
how could I have

35:48.480 --> 35:50.220
gotten that piece of land?

35:50.280 --> 35:51.380
My goods are

35:51.400 --> 35:52.460
one-third cheaper

35:52.710 --> 35:53.920
than other similar ones

35:53.920 --> 35:55.580
in this factory.

35:56.190 --> 35:56.630
Here,

35:56.630 --> 35:57.440
let me introduce.

35:57.440 --> 35:59.410
This is my wife, Guo Xiangling.

35:59.710 --> 36:00.590
Hello.

36:02.150 --> 36:02.670
Oh,

36:03.000 --> 36:04.000
here's my card.

36:04.120 --> 36:04.800
My surname is Huo,

36:04.800 --> 36:07.140
as in "genuine goods."

36:07.160 --> 36:08.740
Huo as in "foodie."

36:08.880 --> 36:10.040
Here you go again.

36:10.630 --> 36:11.690
Tell me, everyone,

36:11.960 --> 36:13.590
is Mrs. Lu beautiful?

36:13.590 --> 36:14.790
Gorgeous, isn't she?

36:15.960 --> 36:16.670
Right?

36:19.400 --> 36:20.400
I thought I had every move

36:20.400 --> 36:21.730
calculated perfectly.

36:22.860 --> 36:24.400
But I forgot one thing—

36:24.430 --> 36:26.030
I'm terrible at reading men.

36:29.280 --> 36:30.550
That man, when he wants

36:31.810 --> 36:33.230
something he can't have,

36:34.360 --> 36:36.550
he'll use every trick and means

36:36.550 --> 36:37.570
to get it.

36:38.920 --> 36:40.980
He had to prove himself to his father.

36:42.850 --> 36:44.910
That meant getting that piece of land

36:45.770 --> 36:47.750
and building the resort.

36:49.070 --> 36:49.920
So

36:52.320 --> 36:53.630
when Dad refused to sell the factory

36:53.630 --> 36:54.590
to Lu Zhongyue,

36:56.660 --> 36:58.430
he set things up so the factory

36:59.830 --> 37:01.690
could no longer stay in business.

37:02.150 --> 37:02.920
Pay up!

37:02.940 --> 37:04.570
Zhou Jun, pay up!

37:04.670 --> 37:06.790
Zhou Jun, pay up!

37:06.810 --> 37:08.590
Zhou Jun, pay up!

37:08.620 --> 37:10.800
Zhou Jun, pay up!

37:10.800 --> 37:13.360
Give us back our money!

37:13.440 --> 37:15.090
Zhou Jun, pay up!

37:15.120 --> 37:16.900
Zhou Jun, pay up!

37:16.920 --> 37:19.320
Zhou Jun, pay up!

37:20.190 --> 37:21.510
I wouldn't say

37:23.320 --> 37:26.030
Lu Zhongyue can control everything,

37:27.850 --> 37:29.400
but dealing with the two of us

37:29.400 --> 37:30.800
is a piece of cake for him.

37:32.630 --> 37:34.100
I'm telling you all this

37:34.190 --> 37:35.150
because I really hope you can

37:35.150 --> 37:36.350
see reality clearly.

37:38.770 --> 37:40.680
Lu Xixiao and Lu Zhongyue

37:41.480 --> 37:43.030
are father and son.

37:44.720 --> 37:45.780
Do you really think

37:46.360 --> 37:48.360
they'd turn against each other?

37:59.250 --> 38:00.160
Have an apple.

38:12.860 --> 38:13.740
You should go.

38:31.000 --> 38:32.170
We probably won't

38:32.880 --> 38:34.280
see each other again.

38:38.100 --> 38:39.360
Take care of yourself.

39:10.590 --> 39:11.630
I've told you

39:11.630 --> 39:12.840
about this plan over

39:12.840 --> 39:13.700
and over again.

39:13.710 --> 39:14.550
Everyone has to

39:14.550 --> 39:16.470
get everything done well.

39:16.500 --> 39:17.610
What did you do?

39:17.640 --> 39:18.440
Do you hear me?

39:40.070 --> 39:41.240
Lu Zhongyue,

39:42.110 --> 39:44.030
I'll make you lose everything.

39:48.140 --> 39:50.060
Here's a small part of the materials

39:50.060 --> 39:51.930
regarding Lu Zhongyue
and Boxing Construction's

39:51.930 --> 39:53.920
past related projects.

39:54.250 --> 39:55.420
I have more.

39:56.720 --> 39:58.340
You might be interested.

40:01.170 --> 40:02.500
What's your condition?

40:04.920 --> 40:05.960
I want to join the resort's

40:05.960 --> 40:06.880
Phase II project team.
